<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">GAL GAL GAL - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">GAL GAL GAL - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">GAL GAL GAL - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">GAL GAL GAL</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="s">Itek yi Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1" />Icɛr yiŋɛ ire bǝn Bulus inǝ du ilɛ kɛ Arik, iwaŋ ndi ba neshir nuŋ ne sharu ba, ama ai Yesɔ Kristi bǝn Arik Tetɛɛ amɔr waŋ ndi nɛ lu nǝ bɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2" />Bɔbɔk abǝ zǝ Arik abaŋ ndi ayi ayaŋa nɛ lɔk mǝ nǝ ishar yi tǝk abɛ akabaŋkɔŋ ayi Galantiya: <verse eid="GAL 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Tǝ Arik Tetɛɛ amɔr bǝn Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi be zhin itazhɔk bǝn isɔŋ kǝ sǝk. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />waŋ ndi nɛ nǝk tu maa nǝ lalɛ mɔr tǝ bɛ ta ta shur nǝ kab kǝ na ki mimin, Kristi nɛ nǝk tu maa nǝ lalɛ mɔr, nǝ zǝ lɛ kǝ Arik bǝn Tetɛɛ amɔr. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />Arik be yi nǝ gbar iyaŋ klɛtu bǝn yaŋ klɛtu! Bǝ yemɛ.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilɛ didik nuŋ ba naŋ kǝŋe ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ilɛ mɛ duŋ me sak ŋɔk nɛ nu ndi Mnǝ wɔ izhin kam gɔŋ nǝk waŋ ndi nɛ zhɔzhin nǝ iyaŋ klɛtu nǝ tazhɔk iyi Kristi tǝ kam zǝ lɛnuŋ kǝ sha, <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />keŋ ndi ba yi lɛ didik ba. Anuŋ ne yik ndi akam zhin ate kpukpur, tena wɔb te ba abɛ ŋun lɛ didik kɛ Kristi me. <verse eid="GAL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />kɔ ate yi ndi ayi taba kɔ inǝ shar ayou Arik inǝ rɛ gbarshu te du lɛ didik kǝ men keŋ ndi bata ne du zhin ne kǝ ba, iki mimin bǝ vuŋu! <verse eid="GAL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />Ndi ta neka bla, neme, nga Bulus mna ndi: Te yi ndi ner nuŋ ate du zhin lɛ didik kǝ men inaŋ keŋ ndi izhin ne ta nyɛmɛ ne kǝ, iki mimin bǝ vuŋu!<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Ka iyiŋe na ndi ngam wɔb tǝm baŋ asusun aye aneshir nǝ tanyɛmɛi? Bai tǝ ame ba! Iki yi wɔb muŋ ai tanyɛmɛ ye Arik! Ka Ngam wɔb tǝ aneshir bɛ nyɛr mǝ? Ate yi ndi M zǝn wɔb na amɛ, bam na yi gɛn ayou Kristi ba.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arik wa ne zhɔ Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Duŋ mǝ bla zhin, akpa amuŋ, tǝ lɛ didik kǝ men keŋ ndi mne du kɛ bai ki ndi neshir ne nakǝ ba. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Bam ne takɛ rɛ ben nuŋ ba, kɔ nuŋ ne tsar me ne kǝ ba; ne yiŋɛ, mne nta kǝ ne rimla rɛ ben Yesɔ Kristi.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Ndika izhin ne wɔ kiki yi na muŋ nɛ ankɔŋ anǝ zǝ anǝ Yahudawa, ndi Mnǝ wɔb akla tǝm sak abǝ zǝ Arik iya tǝm var ba ntǝ ntɛn. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />Mnǝ yi nǝ ti kɛ anǝ Yahudawa anuŋ ndi ayi asǝsa amuŋ nǝ zǝ tsar zhi Arik, tǝna nǝk tu ŋgɔŋ nǝ zǝ kiki yi taada iyi na atetɛ amɔr. <verse eid="GAL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Fe ndi Arik, waŋ ndi ne kam me anyak ire ŋli muŋ tɛ zhɔm ndi nǝ tǝu nǝ tazhɔk maa, ne teu ma <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />tɛ tsar mǝ Izu maa, tǝ mbǝ du lɛ didik kǝ men nɛ atu maa nǝ miŋ aneshir abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba, bam ne ntǝ rib nuŋ ba, <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />kam ne yuŋ gar Urshelima tem ntǝ yik abǝ du lɛ kɛ Arik ndi ne kum ti. Ama mne nku ngar iŋa kɛ Arabiya andanda te shi ŋur nkam kɔmɔ ne Damaskɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Ankyak ndi ase tar ne gayir, mne gar Urshelima te yik Biturus te ntǝ bɛr wur ane tuŋ bene bɔu. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Bam nǝ yik inuŋ nǝ min kɛ abǝ du lɛ kɛ Arik ba, anaga yi Yakubu izumen anǝ Ŋgɔŋ ankyak. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Mbla zhin ne ti kɛ Arik te ki yiŋ ndi mcɛr zhin neyi bai mu ba. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Ndi iyiŋɛ ne gayir, Mne ŋgar Suriya ben Kilikiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Abǝ zǝ Arik ndi Kristi ayi bene bǝba ne Yahudiya bane zhim ba. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Ne naga wɔ lɛ ne tu amuŋ: &lt;&lt;Tǝ Shaulu waŋ ndi ne bene sak ta iya azǝzaŋa ataga yi iner ne du lɛ kɛ tanyɛmɛ keŋ ndi ane wɔb zhɔk kɛ adɔmɔ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Fe ne gbar Arik asak ne ta Arik muŋ.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="s">Abɛ zǝ Yesɔ na ndum ne ta Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Ndi ase wur anenas ne gayir mne yuŋ gar Urshelima, ne mkpaŋ kǝŋe tane yi bǝn Barnaba. Tena gli Titus maayi. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />Mnǝ zǝ lɛ kɛ rimla tǝ mblaa ba lɛ didik keŋ ndi mnǝ du kǝ nǝ miŋ kɛ abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba. Neme mnǝ na kǝ kuŋkum bǝn abaŋ ndi ayi angɔŋgɔŋ, ne te sǝsǝk te kǝr ndum kɛ na muŋ bǝ yi sha ba. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />Inǝ tsǝn amuŋ Titus, iwa maayi ayi awǝnǝ Helenawa, banɛ kɔgu zǝk nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ ba, <verse eid="GAL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />ndi ame anuŋ nɛ wɔb te aba abɛ duŋǝ iyemɛ. Ana nyak tɛ aba yi abǝ zǝ Arik, aner abaŋa afir ayir miŋ mɔr tǝ abe tɔ kiyi na mɔr, tɛ awɔb ka abai yik izukzhɔk iyn ndi ta yime neyi nǝ min kǝ Kristi Yesɔ. Awɔb tǝ ta bǝ yi agɛn, <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />fe ate di bɛ nyak izub yi lɛ didik bɛ yi min, bata nǝk ba atu amɔr ba kɔ watsɔb.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Ate yi ndi anuŋ ayik tedi aba yi adidik kɔka aba aye nii ayi ki zhin bene bɛm; Arik ba te ambuk ne ki ye abɛm ba, aneshir ayuŋɔ bane sak kinuŋ ne lɛ kɛ bla muŋ ba. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Ndi ne yeme, ne yik te Arik ne nǝm ndum kɛ du lɛ didik ben abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba. Ir keŋ ndi Biturus ne yime ben Yahudawa. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Fe nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Arik nɛ duŋ mǝ Mbǝ yi nǝ du lɛ kɛ Arik nɛ abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba, ndi nɛ na duŋ Biturus abɛ yi nǝ du lɛ kɛ Arik bǝn Yahudawa. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Yakubu, Biturus bǝn Yɔɔna, aba neyi tanda, anem ben Barnaba ŋɔk didik kɛ bine ndi neyik didik keŋ ndi ne neme kɛ. Ne ta nyɛmɛ te tabǝ gar bǝn abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba, te aba bɛ gar ben Yahudawa. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Iki ndi awɔbǝ kǝr ta bǝ ŋursuk ben abɛ yik ya ba, waŋ ai ki yiŋ ndi mne shur ayi tem nai.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ne gbaŋ Biturus atɔŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Ndi Biturus ne nyɛ Antakiya, mne vǝu ne ti maa, te ki na maa ba rɛ ba. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Kamin aneshir anuŋ abɛ nyɛ are bǝn Yakubu, nɛ zǝn li kili bǝn abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba. Fe ndi ne nyɛ, ne kama ru gɔgɔŋ te tun tu maa aglɛ rumɔ bǝn abaŋ ndi ba yi Yahudawa ba te ate sǝsǝk abaŋ ndi ayi ne nga abɛ kɔk zǝk. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Anǝ Yahudawa anuŋ abǝ zǝ Arik imɛnyi akɔ na ndi abǝ klu sǝsǝk tǝ vuŋ Biturus; bǝn Barnaba nǝ kamgli tɛ zǝ ba adur.<verse eid="GAL 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Ndi Mnǝ yik ba tsǝn nɛ ankɔŋ adidik anǝ zub yi lɛ didik kɛ Arik ba, mne bla Biturus ne ti mǝnɛ bɔbɔk, &lt;&lt;Uyi awɔnǝ Yahudawa, ne me u na ndi bɔu yi iŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba. Tǝ iye anii, fe, te u shɔk abaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba te bɛ zǝ kiki yi na Yahudawai?<verse eid="GAL 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />Iyeme, taba abaŋ ndi ta yi Yahudawa nǝ ŋli ba aye &lt;&lt;abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba abǝ lalɛ&gt;&gt;ndi azhɔ bama. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Nǝ yiŋɛ tanǝ zhi tǝ neshir azhɔgu nɛ ankɔŋ adidik bǝn Arik ankya nǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yesɔ Kristi, kzhin bɛ zhi te neshir ba alieru ne zǝ nkanlɛ iyi cɛr Musa ba.Taba, mɔr yi, nǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yesɔ Kristi. Fe taba, imɔr yime, nǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Kristi Yesɔ tǝ tabǝ yi adidik bǝn Arik nǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Kristi, ba nǝ zǝ icɛr yi Musa ba, tǝ ishur ayi nǝ cɛr yi Musa ba.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Fe, nǝ yiŋe, ndi ta wɔb tǝ abe zhɔk ta nɛ ankɔŋ adidik bǝn Arik nǝ biŋ mɔr nǝ min kɛ Kristi, nɛ yikta yi abǝ lalɛ, ir keŋ ndi abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba ayimɛ tǝ ai yi duŋ Kristi ana ndum kǝ gɛn nɛ atu yi lalɛi? Ba ye me ba! <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Te yi ndi mne kam mɛ iki yiŋ ndi mne zǝre, mne tsar tu muŋ tǝ myi ne yaŋ zǝ icɛr yi Musa tem zǝ Arik. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Fena ndi nkan lɛ nǝ cɛr yi Musa tu maa, ankyak, M nǝ nku, iŋun nǝ min kǝ cɛr yi Musa nǝ tu maa, tǝ mbǝ yi tsitsir bǝn Arik. M nǝ ru iku bǝn Kristi nǝ tu kuŋkun kǝ gen, <verse eid="GAL 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />tǝ ba yi ngawa yi tsitsir ba, ama ayi Kristi wa yi tsitsir nǝ min muŋ. Ivli kǝŋe ndi M yimɛ nɛ kǝ azǝzaŋa, M yi tsitsir nǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Izu Arik, iwaŋ ndi nɛ nyer mǝ tɛ nǝm ivli maa nɛ atu amuŋ. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />Bam nǝ mbaŋ ina didik yɛ Arik nyak ne kɔnsa ba, atei ndi itsin tsetser ayik kɛ ne cɛr yi Musa, Iku kɛ Kristi iyi sha!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s">Tanyɛme kɔ kai shur ayi ne cɛr yi Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Izhineba bliblik aner abɛ Galantiya! Ŋɔwa ne tsar zhin ten? Ne ayi amin Yesɔ Kristi ne ru abɛm ndende ndi nɛ kpaŋu nǝ kuŋkun kɛ gen. <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Ndi M tei wɔb tem zhi ki zhin ben zhineba: Izhin ne ta Izhu tsetser yɛ Arik nǝ cɛr yi Musa, ka nǝ tanyɛmɛ nǝ ki ndi izhin ne wɔi nii? <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Izhin yi abliblik kikinǝ? Ndi zhin nǝka kuti tanyɛmɛ ne Izhu tsetser yɛ Arik; fena ne klɛtu izhin tena di zhin nǝk atu nǝ na ye neshir i? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Tǝ zhin ne yik iya yi sha ndi tei yi amɛ izhin ne te iya iyi shai? <verse eid="GAL 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />kɔka Arik anǝk zhin Izhu maa bǝn ndum vuŋ anu ne miŋ min te zhin ŋub cɛr yi Musa, ka te izhin tanyɛmɛ ne ki ndi zhin ne wɔi netu yi Kristi ni?<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Tɔ zhin Ibrai: &lt;&lt;Nɛ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Arik, te Arik ne lǝk Ibrai tɛ duŋu ayi ner tsetser.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Izhin bǝ zhi, te abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ ben Arik aye amumun Ibrai. <verse eid="GAL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8" />Ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di te Arik atei na abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba azhɔgɔ anenen nɛ tanyɛmɛ, tena bla Ibrai lɛ didik kɛ ti: &lt;&lt;Ntun bɔbɔk atei ta anu adidik ne aŋɔk amaa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9" />Fe abaŋ ndi nɛ tanyɛmɛ nɛ asusun anyɛ te ta anu adidik bǝn Ibrai, iner tsetser.<verse eid="GAL 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi ne ŋub cɛr yi Musa ayi ne angus akɛ itenu amimin, tǝ nɛ cɛr nǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik tedi: &lt;&lt;Itenu mimin iyi netu ayi waŋ ndi ba na kiki yiŋ ndi ne cɛrǝ ne cɛr yi Musa ba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Imen yi ndende te nuŋ ba yi tsetser ne ti kɛ Arik netu cɛr yi Musa ba, fǝna,&lt;&lt;Inǝ tsǝntsǝn didik atei yi tsetser nǝ tanyɛmɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Icɛr yi Musa bane zhik nǝ tanyɛmɛ ba, ndi amɛ, &lt;&lt;Ineshir waŋ ndi ana ki yiŋɛ icɛre idi atei lieru neyi&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Ama nǝ kam ta itɛnu nɛ atu amɔr iyi Kristi nɛ ta ta azhɔk ndi icɛr yi Musa nǝ glii nyemɛ; tǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik idi, &lt;&lt;Iwaŋ ndi iwa ne kɔru nǝ tu kuŋkun ayi nɛ angus akǝ tɛnu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Kristi ne ta ta zhɔk te duŋ inǝk anu adidik ndi ne nek Ibrai bena nyɛ ben abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba ne ŋɔk kɛ Kristi Yesɔ, te duŋ ne ta nyɛmɛ mɔr bǝ duŋ ta bǝ ta ikpa nyak yi Izhu Tsetser.<verse eid="GAL 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Icɛr Musa ben kpa nyak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Akpa amuŋ, duŋ me mbaŋ rɛ kɔte bɛr tayi nǝ sɔŋ kɛ goŋ mimi. Ir kɛ ndi inuŋ ai kam aŋyak kɔ iner abɛ nyaŋ nǝ kpa nyak iyi neshir ndi neka mǝne kpai anyak, fe ne yeme. <verse eid="GAL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Kiki yi men kpa nyaga ne yi ne tu ayi Ibrai ben vǝvǝn ne ŋli amaa. Ilɛ kɛ Arik banǝ di&lt;&lt;iŋli,&gt;&gt; watɔ aner tetɛk, ama&lt;&lt;ŋli,&gt;&gt; watɔ ner zhiin ankyak, azhɔu tǝ, Kristi. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Iki ndim blama idi: Icɛr yi Musa, ne bla kǝ ase sɔkwur amɛ nas nǝ sɔk tar ayi nyɛ, Arik bane tun icɛr Musa ma akpa nyak tɛ na mǝne zhik lɛ kɛ kpa nyaga ne kɔnsa ba. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Fe ate yi ndi inǝk yɛ Arik nǝ sɔŋ nɛtu cɛr yi Musa, fena ba tei na yi nɛtu ayi kpa nyak maa ba. Ndi amɛ, ane yi nɛtu ayi kpa nyak tǝ duŋ Arik nɛ nǝk Ibrai inǝk yuŋɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Tǝ, ayɛ nii, nɛ yi duŋ nkanlɛ yi acɛr Musa mai? Nǝ nyaŋ icɛr nuŋ nǝ tumɔ tǝ abe zhi tǝ aye nii ai lalɛ, tɛna duŋǝ bǝ baŋ mkpaŋ sɛ nǝ nye ilǝla ayou Ibrai, iwaŋ ndi nɛ kpa anyak nɛ atu amaa. Icɛr yi Musa ma ane nǝk abǝ shar ayou Arik neyi, bǝn waŋ ndi ayi nɛ atsutsu nǝ lɛ kǝ bla maa. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Fe nǝ kli nɛ atsutsu, ba klɛ gar zhin ba, fena; Arik wa kiki maa ayi zhin.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21" />Ate yi cɛr yi Musa ma, fena, ne kyak kiki yi kpa nyak Arik i? Bane te ba! Fe ate yi ndi nɛ nǝk cɛr yi Musa tǝ bɛ zhɔk ta nɛ ankɔŋ anǝ rɛ, ankyak ina ki didik itei nǝk ta nyɛr ne cɛr yi Musa. <verse eid="GAL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22" />Ne me ilɛ kɛ Arik ne bla tedi gɔŋmimi iyi ne jaru anǝ lalɛ, te duŋ ki yiŋ ndi nɛ kpai anyak, ne nǝge ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yesɔ Kristi, abɛ kana nek abaŋ ndi ne ta nyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu menyi.<verse eid="GAL 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Kamin itanyɛmɛ yiŋɛ bǝ nyɛ, ilɛ kǝ cɛr yi Musa ne glii ta, ta ne yi ne jaru se ndi Arik nɛ gli itanyɛmɛ ru abɛm. <verse eid="GAL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Fena icɛr yi Musa nǝ gli ta tǝ Kristi ne shɛ nye, tǝ duŋ ta bǝ zhɔk ta anenen bǝn Arik nǝ tanyɛmɛ. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Azizaŋa ndi itanyɛmɛ neka nyɛ, bata na yi ne angus akɛ ŋub ne cɛr yi Musa ba.<verse eid="GAL 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amumun abɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Izhin bɔbɔk yi amumun abɛ Arik nɛ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Yesɔ Kristi, <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />tǝ bɔbɔk minɛ ndi nɛ su zhin ne miŋ kɛ Kristi te kuu zhin ne anklu bǝn Kristi. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Fe nuŋ ba yi kaaŋkaŋ nǝ min kǝ awɔnǝ Yahudawa bǝn iwaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba, igɛn kɔ ka ayi inǝ kɔb, lulum kɔ ka ayi iwa, te bɔbɔk mine izhin yi zhiin ne miŋ Yesɔ Kristi. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />atei ndi izhin yi abɛ Kristi, fena izhin yi nga ŋli kɛ Ibrai, tena yi alɛla ne lɛ kɛ kpa nyak kɛ Arik.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Iki yiŋ ndi mblama atei ndi ilǝla ayi vǝvǝn, ba yi kaaŋkaŋ bǝn igɛn ba, ne zhi te akɔb ayi Tetɛɛ me ayi amaa. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />Nɛ tǝ nǝ shur ayi anuŋkub bǝn acicɛ abaŋ ndi atɔ ba shak ayi sɛ nǝ mkpaŋ keŋ ndi tetɛɛ amaa nɛ duŋɔ sɔŋsɔŋ kɛ tu maa. <verse eid="GAL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Nɛ ankɔŋ azhiin awaŋa, taba mɔr yi, ta nǝ yi agɛn ngli izhu ŋgɔŋgɔŋ yi shu tǝ shi yir izhu tsetser yi duŋ ta flu. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Fena ndi mkpaŋ ne nyɛ, Arik ne shar Izu maa, iŋle kɛ iwa, iŋle ne miŋ lɛ kɛ cɛr yi Musa, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />te abaŋ ndi ayi ne angus ayi cɛr yi Musa be yik itazhɔk, te duŋ ta bǝ ta ishak ayi mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ amumun amaa. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Tǝ izhin yi amumun, Arik ne shar Izhu Tsetser iyi Zu maa nǝ min asusun amɔr, Izhu ndi azhɔ tedi, &lt;&lt;Tetɛɛ, Tetɛɛ muŋ Ŋgɔŋ&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Neme bau na yi igɛn ba, uyi izu; fena teyi ndi uyi izu, Arik ne duŋu bǝ yi lǝla.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ishur ayi Bulus ne tu ner abɛ Galantiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Ikukub, ndi ba zhin nǝ zǝn zhi Arik ba, izhin nǝ yi agɛn nɛ angus abaŋ ndi neyi abǝ zǝn zǝ ishetan. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Fe azǝzaŋa ndi izhin nǝ zhi Arik ka, mbǝ ndi, azǝzaŋa ndi Arik nɛ zhi zhin fe anii tǝ zhin kam gɔŋ nǝk abaŋ ndi asuk kpa tɛna wɔ lɔ susun men nǝ izhu ŋgɔŋgɔŋ? Aye nii duŋ zhin sɔ yi agɛn amen tǝ na yi amɛ? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Izhin ŋub iber ndi iyii zhin didik bǝn ihwa yi rɛ zhin bǝn mkpaŋ kǝ rɛ zhin bǝn asɛ i! <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />M nklu sǝsǝk min, tǝ ayi ndi mnǝ nku hrie nɛtu amin.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />M ben zhin, akpa amuŋ na zhin kiyiŋ ndi M nai. Nǝ iyiŋe bɔbɔk, M yi ndi izhineba. Ba zhin nǝ laam lɛ nuŋ ba. <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />Izhin nǝ shuzhi iki yiŋ ndi nǝ duŋ M nǝ du zhin lɛ didik kɛ men nǝ kuti; nǝ min kǝ zǝn lɔ kpa muŋ. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ne mɛ ilɔ muŋɔ nɛ yi lɛn susun nɛ atu amin zhin, ba zhin nǝ tam nǝ kpa ti ba kɔ iyar mǝ ba. Ama, izhin nǝ tam aŋɔk ayaa ndi Myi inǝ bla shar ayou Arik, ayii ndi ngam yi Yesɔ Kristi ne tu maa. <verse eid="GAL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Izhin nǝ nyɛr ngɔŋ! Anii nǝ na? Nga muŋ yi mdi izhin ibǝ kpɔb ayi amin, izhin tǝ yaa ma, tǝ baŋɛ nǝm. <verse eid="GAL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Tǝm nǝ nkam yi inǝ tǝ zɔr amin ndim mbla zhin lɛ didik yi?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Aneshir ayuŋɔ anǝk atu tǝ aba bɛ ruk zhin anaŋ, ama banǝ nkɔŋ kǝ rɛ ba, iki ndi awɔb nai ma ate te ba abɛ gbaŋ zhin agli atibɛ bǝn abɛta, te zhin bǝ nǝk atu bǝnɛ ba. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />Ire tǝ bɛ nǝk atu, teyi ndi iname ire, bǝ nai kɔte bɛr tayi, kǝr bǝyi se mkpaŋ ndi myi ben abɛ zhin ba. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Izhineba amumun amuŋ! mtar ndi, ir keŋ ndi iyaa aŋli, M wɔ amɛ nǝ lɔ kpa ne atu amin se ikpa kǝ Kristi nǝ ŋlɔ nǝ miŋ min. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />ka abɛdi myi ben abɛ zhin tena sen kɔr kɛ ilɛ muŋ, tem lɛ ncɔk netu amin!<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔ ir kǝ Ajara bǝn Saratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Duŋ mǝ rib abaŋ ndi nɛ tanyɛmɛ nǝ ki ndi icɛr yi Musa: ba zhin nǝ zhi ki ndi icɛr yi Musama ibla ka? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Nɛ di tǝ Ibrai neyi nɛ amumun amɛ yaa, izhin ayi ŋli kɛ iwa gɛn fe nuŋɔ ayou iwa nǝ ne bun amaa. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Izu maa nǝ ŋli iwa gɛne nɛ ŋliu ir keŋ ndi aŋli me, fena inǝ ŋli iwa nǝ bun amaa ayi kpa nyak iye Arik.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24" />Iki yiŋɛ atei ya baŋǝ ndi nkanlɛ, te iwama ayi ntǝk yaa iyi kpa nyak. Ikpa nyak nuŋ Arik ne nǝge nǝ gbu Sinei te ŋli amumun abaŋ ndi atei yi agɛn: Iwa Ajara. <verse eid="GAL 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25" />Fena Ajara aklɛkli ndi gbu Sinei ne Arabiya ndi ne te anenen ne ntun ŋgɔŋ yi Urshelima, te ayi ne miŋ kɛ tǝ gɛn bǝn amunɔ maa. <verse eid="GAL 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Ama Urshelima ndi iyi ne shu ikinuŋ bai tǝ kǝ ba, neme wa iyah amɔr Saratu. <verse eid="GAL 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Tǝ ne cɛr:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">&lt;&lt;Ubǝ mlak nyɛr, Uyi Iwa klu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Waŋ ndi bane ŋli amumun ba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Ru abɛm te zhin ŋgɔŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Uwa waŋ ndi bau ne zen zhin ŋli ba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Tǝ amumun abɛ iwa waŋ ndi ba yi ne zo gu gli bama ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Inaŋ iwa waŋ ndi ayi ne lulum.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Azizaŋa, izhineba, akpa amuŋ, izhi yi amumun abe Arik nǝ kpa nyak maa, ndi Ishaku ane yimɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Nǝ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ ivǝvǝn waŋ ndi nɛ ŋliu ir keŋ ndi aŋlimɛ ne nǝk waŋ ndi nɛ ŋliu ma iya tǝ ayi Izhu tsetser ye Arik; tǝ na yi anenen azǝzaŋa. <verse eid="GAL 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Tǝ ilɛ kɛ Arik ne di kikini? &lt;&lt;Yar iwa gɛne rumɔ bǝn vǝvǝn amaa, te izu iwa gɛne batei gab kinuŋ te nǝgu ba ne iki iyi izu iwa ne bun ami. <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Fena, akpa amuŋ, bata yi amumun abɛ iwa gɛn ba, tayi abɛ iwa nǝ bun.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s">Ita zhɔk iyi Yesɔ Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Izuk zhɔk ai ki yiŋ ndi ta yimɛ neyi, Kristi nɛ ta ta zhɔk! ndi aner abǝ zuk shur, tǝ kǝr izhin bǝ na kam yi agɛn ba.<verse eid="GAL 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Wɔ zhin! Nga, Bulus, me bla zhin, izhin te duŋ a kɔk zhin zǝk Kristi ba tei yi kinuŋ bɔbɔk bane abɛ zhin ba. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />Duŋ M na gbaaŋ kɔtǝ ŋɔ atɔŋ iwaŋ ndi ate duŋ abɛ kɔgu zǝk tǝ wa abe zǝ ibla cɛr yi Musa bɔbɔk. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Anuŋ amin abaŋ ndi awɔbtǝ bɛ duŋ ba na ki anenen bǝn Arik nǝ zǝ icɛr yi Musa izhin nǝ sɛr kluk bǝn Kristi. Izhin yi nɛ abɛm nǝ ta zhɔk ye Arik. <verse eid="GAL 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Atei taba, zhɔk susun mɔr yi Arik atei nyak ta nǝ ŋɔkli maa; fe waŋa ai ki ndi ta ŋubǝ nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ Izhu ye Arik ndi azǝn na ndum nǝ tanyɛmɛ mɔr. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Ndi ta tǝ yi nǝ min kǝ Kristi Yesɔ, kai kɔk zǝk kɔ kai iyaŋ kɔk zǝk banǝ sɛn ba bɔbɔk; Iki ngɔŋɔ yi ai tanyɛmɛ ndi ina ndum nǝ nyɛr.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Izhin ne klu iklu didik! tǝ ai ŋɔwa nɛ yar zhin na zubɔi? Nɛ na kikin tɛ cok zhin? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Ba yi Arik wa nɛ nai amɛ ba, ŋɔwa nɛ zhɔ zhin. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />&lt;&lt;Mbumbur atuntu watsɔb iyi duŋ mumuŋ yi ca wun,&gt;&gt; ndi abla. <verse eid="GAL 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />Mnǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɛ zhin ne sak kɛ Ŋgɔŋ, ba zhin tei zǝ lɛ kɛ nuŋ te duŋ muŋ ba. Iwaŋ ndi alɔm zhin, kɔ abe yi ŋɔwa, atei sagu iya. <verse eid="GAL 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ama ate yi nga, akpa amuŋ, te yi ndi men nǝk du lɛ kɛ kɔk zǝk, te anii duŋ me nak ri yik iya i? Ndi iye me zumimin iyi ne kpaŋ Yesɔ ne kuŋkun kɛ gen ne tyagǝ a hrie. <verse eid="GAL 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />Ate yi abaŋ ndi ne lɔm zhin netu ayi kɔk zǝk, ne yik muŋ abɛ ru ate sɔŋ kpla!<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Izhineba ba, akpa amuŋ, ne ta zhin azhɔk te izhin bǝ yi sha. Ne me kǝr zhin bɛ zǝ iki yiŋ ndi kpa min wɔ bǝ ba, duŋ nyɛr bǝ duŋ zhin yi agɛn nɛ akpa. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Tǝ icɛr yi Musa nǝ nǝk kɛ bɔbɔk iyi mbwab zhiin: &lt;&lt;Nyɛr kpami ndi u nyɛr mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Izhin te ta ina kɛ akpa min, waŋa ayi ankɔŋ anǝ ŋlɔk akpa min.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itsin ne izhu tsetser</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />Iki yiŋ ndi mbla ma: izhin bǝ duŋ Izhu tsetser itsar zhin itsǝn didik, tǝ ba zhin tei zǝ kiki yiŋ ndi kpa min awɔbǝ ba. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Tǝ ize iki yiŋ ndi ikpa wɔ bǝ akyak akpa yi ben izhu tsetser. izhu tsetser akyak akpa yi ben iki yiŋ ndi ikpa wɔ bǝ. Te a kyak kpa yi, te kǝr ubɛ na ki yiŋ ndi uwɔbǝ ba. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Te yi ndi izhu tsetser igli zhin tsǝne, ndɔmi ba yi ne zǝ lɛ keŋ ndi nɛ nǝk kɛ nǝ cɛr yi Musa ba.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Iki yiŋ ndi kpa neshir nai iyi ndende. Izǝ amba bǝn alulum, ibubu tiŋ, bǝn wɔb na kiki iyi shisha; <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />izǝkur mkpɔk kuŋkun, itɛn.Aneshir akam atǝ zɔr tɛ tsik mgbu; tɛ akam atɛ ankiŋki, mfu, bǝn nyɛr tu. Asɔŋ kaaŋkaŋ bǝn ntǝntǝk; <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />a kyak akpa ayi, ahwa, isɔ ki rǝrǝ, bǝn na kiki nuŋ ndi yiŋe: Mgbaŋ zhin atɔŋ azǝzaŋa ndi mnǝ na men bla zhin: abaŋ ndi ana kiki yiŋe batei yi nǝ gadu nǝ kɔb kɛ Arik ba.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Fe abɛ yi ne Izhu tsetser atanyɛmɛ ne kpa, inyɛr akpa, bǝn isɔŋ kǝ sǝk, bǝn vuŋ susun, ina ki didik, bǝn bu ŋɔk, bǝn tanyɛmɛ, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />bǝn zi tu zhɔk, bǝn vuŋ kpa. Ambuk nǝ cɛr yi Musa ba yimɛ nǝ ir kiki yiŋe ba. <verse eid="GAL 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Abaŋ ndi ayi abɛ Yesɔ Kristi neka ru kiki yiŋ ndi kpa wɔbǝ bǝn kiki iyi tik ayi netu iku kɛ Yesɔ. <verse eid="GAL 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Ate yi ndi ta tsǝn nǝ Izhu Tsetser ta bǝ duŋ Izhu Tsetser bɛ gli ta tsǝnɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Kǝr ta bǝ yi abǝ lǝk atu nǝ shu ba, bǝn abǝ wɔb akla, bǝn abǝ kyak akpa ayi.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="s1">Na aneshir bɔbɔk iki didik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Akpa amuŋ ate yi ndi te vuŋ nuŋ nǝ lalɛ, izhin abaŋ ndi izhin tsǝn ne izhu tsetser izhin bǝ gli nere kam nyak ankɔŋɔ bwe. Izhin bǝ na tǝ zǝǝ tǝ kǝr nuŋ abǝ lɔ zhaku ne lalɛ ba, maayi. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Izhin bǝ lɔk akpamin, nena me izhin tei na kiyiŋ ndi Kristi nɛ di abɛ nai. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Inuŋ ate yik te iwa ayi kinuŋ ayi mu ba yi kinuŋ ba, alɔm tu maa fa. <verse eid="GAL 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />kɔte ŋɔwa bɛ tsar iki na maa atɔ. Fe atei she ŋur asa, ne yaŋ tsar tu maa bǝn nuŋ, <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ gli ihru maa kiki maa.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Ne me, iwaŋ ndi ne tsa ru lɛ kɛ Arik, bɛ gab bɔbɔk kiki didik ndi izhin yimɛ neyi bǝn inǝ tsaru ma.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Kǝr zhin bɛ duŋ alɔm zhin ba: te ba lɔm Arik ba. kɔte ŋɔwa atei sɛr iki yiŋ ndi ne tibɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Iwaŋ ndi te tib nyɛr tu maa itei gliu gar ku, waŋ ndi te tib iki yi izhu tsetser itei gliu gar yik ivli kɛ yaŋ klɛ tu. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Kǝr ta bɛ dǝk ne na ki didik ba te ta tei sɛr iki didik nena didik mɔr. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Ne me, ta te yik mkpaŋ, ta bǝ naa kɔtǝ ŋɔ iki didik, ina amɛ ire ngɔŋ bǝn abaŋ ndi ta yi amunya nǝ tanyɛmɛ.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba kɔk zǝk iyi ba, itsin yayas kɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Izhin bɛ tɔ icɛr ngɔngɔŋ ndi mne cɛr zhin neyi ne ŋɔk muŋ!<verse eid="GAL 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Aneshir abaŋ ndi awɔb kɔk zhin zǝk nǝ mgbymgbyaŋ aye abaŋ ndi awɔb gbar asak tɛna ŋur asa nǝ kiki iye abɛm. Ana mɛ, fena, ankyak tǝ kǝr bɛ sak ba iya nǝ kpɔk tu kuŋkun kǝ gen kǝ Kristi ba. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Kɔ abaŋ ndi azǝ kɔk zǝk ba zǝ cɛr yi Musa ba; aba wɔb tǝ aba bɛ kɔk zhin zǝk tǝ bɛ ŋur asa tǝ izhin nǝ nǝk atu nǝ kɔk zǝk yi kpa. <verse eid="GAL 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Nga me ŋɔr asa ne kpok tu kuŋkun kɛ gen kɛ ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi, waŋ ndi gɔŋmimi ne kpaŋu ne atu muŋ ne me mne kam ayi ne ki yi gɔŋmimi, gɔŋmimi ne kam ayi ben abɛm. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Ne kɔk zǝk ben yaŋ kɔk zǝk, iki ŋgɔŋɔ ayi kam sen. <verse eid="GAL 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Te yi aban ndi azǝ ilɛ kǝŋe nɛ asusun amen, isɔŋ kǝ sǝk bǝn lɔ susun bǝ yi bǝ aba bǝn abǝba bǝn bɔbɔk abaŋ ndi azǝ Arik!<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Nǝ klɛtu: kǝr inuŋ abɛ na nǝm ŋar tu ba, tǝ mmak mkpaa ikǝ yi nǝ kpa muŋ iduŋ mǝ yi igɛn ayou Yesɔ.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Ita zhɔk yi Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi bɛ yi bǝn abɛzhin bɔbɔk, akpa amuŋ. Bǝ yi amɛ.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>